cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Traffic Vision Senegal: measuring the effect of mobility measures from video, with the Dakar 2026 Youth Olympic Games as case study"
abstract: >
  Open-source pipeline that counts road users from existing video (YOLO11 and
  ByteTrack), checks traffic rules (reserved lanes, bans by the hour) and
  estimates the effect of a measure by difference-in-differences, with counts
  corrected by a manual sample and intervals that account for autocorrelated
  traffic. Includes a registry of the mobility measures of the Dakar 2026
  Youth Olympic Games and a simulation study of the estimator.
authors:
